# Keep line endings LF in the repository *and* in working trees on every
# platform. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which checks files
# out as CRLF; Prettier defaults to endOfLine "lf", so `pnpm prettier` then
# fails locally on Windows while passing on Linux CI. Pinning eol=lf here makes
# the check mean the same thing everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
